WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
One of the most interesting things about cybersecurity is there's not a really traditional path.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Here, everyone's come in in very different ways, especially folks who've been in the industry for longer.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:38.000
A lot of people have come from help desk, systems administration, but I've also talked to people who pivoted into cybersecurity from being an archaeologist and a librarian, which I think is really fascinating.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:52.000
I was a middle school English writing teacher for five years, and I loved what I did, but it was very demanding.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Honestly, it didn't pay very much. So I started to consider with my family other options.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:20.000
I decided, "Hey, why not cybersecurity in tech?" So I was working full-time as a teacher, then at nighttime I was studying for the CompTIA Security+ exam.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:32.000
I landed my first role as a security analyst.
